 ok←run _onChange message
 ⍝ Can be invoked by the Scroll or ThumbDrag events, or by setting the value property, each potentially different

 :Select 2⊃message
 :Case '' ⍝ An internal call due to value being changed
     ok←##.NoRes⊣(message[3],0)##.##.Run run ⍝ (We never care about the result when called internally)
 :Case 'onThumbDrag' ⍝ A continuous dragging of the thumb
     ok←1⊣(message[3],0)##.##.Run run
 :Case 'onScroll' ⍝ Scrolling complete
     ok←1⊣(message[4],0)##.##.Run run ⍝ Always approve change; APL+Win can't cancel
 :EndSelect
